      "html": "<button class=\"ds-compose\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M5 19h1.425L16.2 9.225L14.775 7.8L5 17.575zm-1 2q-.425 0-.712-.288T3 20v-2.425q0-.4.15-.763t.425-.637L16.2 3.575q.3-.275.663-.425t.762-.15t.775.15t.65.45L20.425 5q.3.275.437.65T21 6.4q0 .4-.138.763t-.437.662l-12.6 12.6q-.275.275-.638.425t-.762.15zM19 6.4L17.6 5zm-3.525 2.125l-.7-.725L16.2 9.225z\"/></svg><span>Compose</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-compose{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;height:56px;padding:0 24px;border:0;border-radius:16px;background:var(--mail-compose, #c2e7ff);color:var(--mail-on-compose, #001d35);font:500 14px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:box-shadow 150ms ease;}.ds-compose:hover{box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / .18);}.ds-compose:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Send",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-send",
      "description": "Solid primary pill with library interaction states.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-send\">Send</button>",
      "css": ".ds-send{height:40px;padding:0 24px;border:1px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);border-radius:20px;background:var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);color:#fff;font:500 14px/1 Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--el-transition-duration, .3s);}.ds-send:hover{background:var(--el-color-primary-light-3, #4dabff);border-color:var(--el-color-primary-light-3, #4dabff);}.ds-send:active{background:var(--el-color-primary-dark-2, #1064c0);}.ds-send:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-send:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;background:var(--el-color-primary-light-5, #69c0ff);}@media(pointer:coarse),(max-width:767px){.ds-send{min-height:44px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Reply / Forward",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Outlined secondary action in a message.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-secondary\">Reply</button>",
      "css": ".ds-secondary{height:40px;padding:0 24px;border:1px solid var(--el-border-color, #dcdfe6);border-radius:20px;background:var(--el-bg-color, #fff);color:var(--el-text-color-regular, #3c4043);font:500 14px/1 Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color var(--el-transition-duration, .3s);}.ds-secondary:hover{background:var(--el-color-primary-light-9, #e6f7ff);border-color:var(--el-color-primary-light-7, #91d5ff);color:var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);}.ds-secondary:active{border-color:var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);}.ds-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}@media(pointer:coarse),(max-width:767px){.ds-secondary{min-height:44px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon",
      "description": "Labeled compact action with hover, active, and disabled feedback.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-icon\" aria-label=\"Refresh\" title=\"Refresh\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M12 20q-3.35 0-5.675-2.325T4 12t2.325-5.675T12 4q1.725 0 3.3.712T18 6.75V5q0-.425.288-.712T19 4t.713.288T20 5v5q0 .425-.288.713T19 11h-5q-.425 0-.712-.288T13 10t.288-.712T14 9h3.2q-.8-1.4-2.187-2.2T12 6Q9.5 6 7.75 7.75T6 12t1.75 4.25T12 18q1.7 0 3.113-.862t2.187-2.313q.2-.35.563-.487t.737-.013q.4.125.575.525t-.025.75q-1.025 2-2.925 3.2T12 20\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:var(--control-size,36px);height:var(--control-size,36px);border:0;border-radius:var(--control-radius,50%);background:transparent;color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms ease;}.ds-icon:hover{background:var(--el-fill-color-light,#f5f7fa);}.ds-icon:active{background:var(--el-fill-color,#f0f2f5);}.ds-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-icon:disabled{color:var(--el-text-color-disabled,#c0c4cc);cursor:default;}@media(pointer:coarse),(max-width:767px){.ds-icon{min-width:44px;min-height:44px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Folder search",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-search",
      "description": "Search-pill surface with clear action and focus lift.",
      "html": "<form class=\"ds-search\" role=\"search\"><button class=\"ds-search-action\" aria-label=\"Search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M9.5 16q-2.725 0-4.612-1.888T3 9.5t1.888-4.612T9.5 3t4.613 1.888T16 9.5q0 1.1-.35 2.075T14.7 13.3l5.6 5.6q.275.275.275.7t-.275.7t-.7.275t-.7-.275l-5.6-5.6q-.75.6-1.725.95T9.5 16m0-2q1.875 0 3.188-1.312T14 9.5t-1.312-3.187T9.5 5T6.313 6.313T5 9.5t1.313 3.188T9.5 14\"/></svg></button><input type=\"search\" aria-label=\"Search Inbox\" placeholder=\"Search Inbox\" maxlength=\"200\"/><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-search-action\" aria-label=\"Clear search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 13.4l-4.9 4.9q-.275.275-.7.275t-.7-.275t-.275-.7t.275-.7l4.9-4.9l-4.9-4.9q-.275-.275-.275-.7t.275-.7t.7-.275t.7.275l4.9 4.9l4.9-4.9q.275-.275.7-.275t.7.275t.275.7t-.275.7L13.4 12l4.9 4.9q.275.275.275.7t-.275.7t-.7.275t-.7-.275z\"/></svg></button></form>",
      "css": ".ds-search{display:flex;align-items:center;width:100%;max-width:720px;height:48px;border-radius:24px;padding:0 4px;background:var(--mail-search,#e9eef6);}.ds-search:focus-within{background:var(--el-bg-color,#fff);box-shadow:0 1px 6px rgb(0 0 0 / .2);}.ds-search input{width:100%;min-width:0;height:100%;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);font:400 16px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--secondary-text-color,#5f6368);opacity:1;}.ds-search-action{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:40px;height:40px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:var(--secondary-text-color,#5f6368);cursor:pointer;}.ds-search-action:hover{background:var(--mail-nav-hover,#e4e7ec);}.ds-search-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-search{height:44px;}.ds-search input{font-size:14px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Folder navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "Continuous folders with selected tone and one-sided rounding.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Mail navigation\"><button class=\"ds-folder ds-folder-active\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M5 21q-.825 0-1.412-.587T3 19V5q0-.825.588-1.412T5 3h14q.825 0 1.413.588T21 5v14q0 .825-.587 1.413T19 21zm0-2h14v-3h-3q-.75.95-1.787 1.475T12 18t-2.212-.525T8 16H5zm7-3q.8 0 1.475-.413t1.1-1.087q.15-.225.375-.363t.5-.137H19V5H5v9h3.55q.275 0 .5.138t.375.362q.425.675 1.1 1.088T12 16m-7 3h14z\"/></svg><span>Inbox</span></button><button class=\"ds-folder\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m8.85 16.825l3.15-1.9l3.15 1.925l-.825-3.6l2.775-2.4l-3.65-.325l-1.45-3.4l-1.45 3.375l-3.65.325l2.775 2.425zm3.15.45l-4.15 2.5q-.275.175-.575.15t-.525-.2t-.35-.437t-.05-.588l1.1-4.725L3.775 10.8q-.25-.225-.312-.513t.037-.562t.3-.45t.55-.225l4.85-.425l1.875-4.45q.125-.3.388-.45t.537-.15t.537.15t.388.45l1.875 4.45l4.85.425q.35.05.55.225t.3.45t.038.563t-.313.512l-3.675 3.175l1.1 4.725q.075.325-.05.588t-.35.437t-.525.2t-.575-.15zm0-5.025\"/></svg><span>Starred</span></button><button class=\"ds-folder\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m19.8 12.925l-15.4 6.5q-.5.2-.95-.088T3 18.5v-13q0-.55.45-.837t.95-.088l15.4 6.5q.625.275.625.925t-.625.925M5 17l11.85-5L5 7v3.5l6 1.5l-6 1.5zm0 0V7z\"/></svg><span>Sent</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{width:244px;}.ds-folder{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;width:100%;height:36px;padding:0 24px;border:0;border-radius:0 20px 20px 0;background:transparent;color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);font:400 14px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-folder:hover{background:var(--mail-nav-hover,#e4e7ec);}.ds-folder-active{background:var(--mail-selected,#d3e3fd);color:var(--mail-on-selected,#001d35);font-weight:600;}.ds-folder-active:hover{background:var(--mail-selected,#d3e3fd);}.ds-folder:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}@media(pointer:coarse){.ds-folder{height:44px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected mailbox",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-mailbox-selected",
      "description": "Flat selected mailbox, address, and shared role.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-mailbox\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-mailbox-name\">Team</span><span class=\"ds-mailbox-address\">team@example.com</span><span class=\"ds-mailbox-role\">Shared · Reader</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-mailbox{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:220px;padding:8px;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--mail-selected,#d3e3fd);color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);text-align:left;font:400 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;}.ds-mailbox-address{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;max-width:100%;}.ds-mailbox-role{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--el-text-color-regular,#3c4043);font-size:12px;line-height:16px;}.ds-mailbox:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Recipient tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-recipient",
      "description": "Element Plus primary tag with remove control.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tag\"><span>maya@example.com</span><button class=\"ds-tag-remove\" aria-label=\"Remove recipient\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m12 13.4l-4.9 4.9q-.275.275-.7.275t-.7-.275t-.275-.7t.275-.7l4.9-4.9l-4.9-4.9q-.275-.275-.275-.7t.275-.7t.7-.275t.7.275l4.9 4.9l4.9-4.9q.275-.275.7-.275t.7.275t.275.7t-.275.7L13.4 12l4.9 4.9q.275.275.275.7t-.275.7t-.7.275t-.7-.275z\"/></svg></button></span>",
      "css": ".ds-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:22px;padding:0 9px;border:1px solid var(--el-color-primary-light-8,#d9ecff);border-radius:4px;background:var(--el-color-primary-light-9,#e6f7ff);color:var(--el-color-primary,#0b57d0);font:400 12px/1 Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-tag-remove{display:grid;place-items:center;width:14px;height:14px;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:var(--el-color-primary,#0b57d0);cursor:pointer;}.ds-tag-remove:hover{background:var(--el-color-primary,#0b57d0);color:#fff;}.ds-tag-remove:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Unread message row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "row-unread",
      "description": "Continuous sender, subject, preview, and time row; unread weight.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\" role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Maya Chen: A few thoughts on the next release\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Select message\"/><button class=\"ds-row-star\" aria-label=\"Star\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m8.85 16.825l3.15-1.9l3.15 1.925l-.825-3.6l2.775-2.4l-3.65-.325l-1.45-3.4l-1.45 3.375l-3.65.325l2.775 2.425zm3.15.45l-4.15 2.5q-.275.175-.575.15t-.525-.2t-.35-.437t-.05-.588l1.1-4.725L3.775 10.8q-.25-.225-.312-.513t.037-.562t.3-.45t.55-.225l4.85-.425l1.875-4.45q.125-.3.388-.45t.537-.15t.537.15t.388.45l1.875 4.45l4.85.425q.35.05.55.225t.3.45t.038.563t-.313.512l-3.675 3.175l1.1 4.725q.075.325-.05.588t-.35.437t-.525.2t-.575-.15zm0-5.025\"/></svg></button><strong class=\"ds-row-sender\">Maya Chen</strong><div class=\"ds-row-text\"><strong>A few thoughts on the next release</strong><span> – Hi Alex, here are the notes we discussed.</span></div><strong class=\"ds-row-time\">1:30 PM</strong></div>",
      "css": ".ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20px 36px minmax(0,180px) minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:44px;padding:0 16px;background:var(--mail-unread-row,#fff);color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);font:400 14px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease-in-out,box-shadow .15s ease-in-out;}.ds-row:hover,.ds-row:focus-within{background:var(--email-hover-background,#e8f0fe);box-shadow:inset 0 -1px var(--mail-row-border,#e4e7eb),0 1px 3px rgb(0 0 0 / .18);}.ds-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-row-star{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);cursor:pointer;}.ds-row-star:hover{background:var(--el-fill-color-light,#f5f7fa);}.ds-row-star:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--el-color-primary, #0b57d0);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-row-sender,.ds-row-text{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;}.ds-row-text span{color:var(--secondary-text-color,#5f6368);}.ds-row-time{font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-row{grid-template-columns:20px minmax(0,1fr) auto;min-height:88px;gap:4px 12px;}.ds-row-star{display:none;}.ds-row-sender{grid-column:2;}.ds-row-time{grid-column:3;grid-row:1;}.ds-row-text{grid-column:2 / -1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Main surface",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-main",
      "description": "Flat rounded reading/list surface; square on phones.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-main\" aria-label=\"Mail workspace\"><div class=\"ds-main-toolbar\">Inbox</div><p class=\"ds-main-content\">Read, find, and organize your mail.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-main{min-width:0;overflow:hidden;border-radius:16px;background:var(--el-bg-color,#fff);color:var(--el-text-color-primary,#202124);font:400 14px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-main-toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:48px;padding:3px 15px;box-shadow:var(--header-actions-border,inset 0 -1px 0 0 #ebeef5);}.ds-main-content{padding:24px 32px 32px;margin:0;}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-main{border-radius:0;}.ds-main-content{padding:24px 16px 96px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Familiar Mail Workspace",
    "overview": "The Familiar Mail Workspace gives Cloud Mail the recognizable rhythm of Gmail: a cool shell, quiet folder navigation, a broad search field, and a continuous message surface. The configurable site title remains the product identity. Density supports repeated reading and organizing tasks; sender, subject, preview, and time establish the scan order.\n\nLight mode separates a pale shell from white message and reading surfaces. Dark mode uses charcoal and near-black surfaces with pale blue accents. Rounded controls and restrained feedback communicate actions and state. Shipping visuals are CSS and registered SVG icons; this build introduces no generated raster assets.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cool tonal surfaces with blue compose and selection.",
      "Compact sans typography and a continuous message list.",
      "One navigation rail with a modal drawer on smaller screens.",
      "Visible keyboard focus and permission-aware actions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Contrast Rule",
        "body": "Use the defined read, unread, selected, and hover surfaces for their respective message states; unread sender, subject, and time also use bold weight.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Workspace Rule",
        "body": "Keep the main workspace flat at rest. Reserve shadows for focus, hover feedback, floating compose, drawers, and overlays.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do reuse semantic CSS custom properties so light and dark themes follow the effective cascade.",
      "Do retain the single rail, continuous message list, and clear sender/subject/preview hierarchy.",
      "Do use labeled native buttons, visible keyboard focus, and the existing permission gates.",
      "Do let long mail subjects, filenames, and overlay content truncate or wrap according to their established contexts.",
      "Do preserve local draft persistence and recoverable loading, empty, and error states."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add archive, snooze, categories, or trash controls without supported product behavior.",
      "Don't replace registered SVG icons with text glyphs or decorative images.",
      "Don't add shadows to every row or mailbox card at rest.",
      "Don't promote incidental legacy administration styles or sender-authored email styles into the mail workspace system."
    ]
  }
}
